| Clean-up after the Word import: emphasis regularised, idle codes, spaces and styles tidied
| States (all but 1 used only for box lines):
| 1 : normal
| 2 : in BoxBegin or BoxDouble, reading color indicator
| 3 : reading paramaters of svrhs code
| 4 : In C-Centered. text within table of contents
| -1 : in BoxBegin or BoxDouble, without color indicator, discarding text
| -2 : in BoxBegin or BoxDouble, after color indictor, discarding text

| Remove superscript from ordinals (1st, 2nd, 3rd, 4th)
