| Special handling for BoxBegin and BoxDouble, in lieu of IgnoreContents; this allows for colored box markup in Word.
| First rule (both for BoxBegin and BoxDouble): go to state -1, dropping text, if content of style starts as fill line unadorned
|028es|~BB-BoxBegin.|03177777777~|028es|~BB-BoxBegin.|031~1~-1~
|028es|~BD-BoxDouble.|031========~|028es|~BD-BoxDouble.|031~1~-1~
| Second rule (Both for BoxBegin and BoxDouble): go to state 2 after style start, to look for space
|028es|~BB-BoxBegin.|031~|028es|~BB-BoxBegin.|031|028es|~ExactTranslation|031~1~2~
|028es|~BD-BoxDouble.|031~|028es|~BD-BoxDouble.|031|028es|~ExactTranslation|031~1~2~
| Third rule (Both for BoxBegin and BoxDouble):	in state 2, space becomes hard space; transitions to state -2
|032~|030~2~-2~
| Third rule variation: where source is already a hard space
|030~|030~2~-2~
| Fourth rule: return to state 1 at end of BoxBegin or BoxDouble
|028ee|~BB-BoxBegin.|031~|028ee|~BB-BoxBegin.|031~-1~1~
|028ee|~BD-BoxDouble.|031~|028ee|~BD-BoxDouble.|031~-1~1~
|028ee|~BB-BoxBegin.|031~|028ee|~ExactTranslation|031|028ee|~BB-BoxBegin.|031~2~1~
|028ee|~BD-BoxDouble.|031~|028ee|~ExactTranslation|031|028ee|~BD-BoxDouble.|031~2~1~
|028ee|~BB-BoxBegin.|031~|028ee|~ExactTranslation|031|028ee|~BB-BoxBegin.|031~-2~1~
|028ee|~BD-BoxDouble.|031~|028ee|~ExactTranslation|031|028ee|~BD-BoxDouble.|031~-2~1~

