| Following several sections of rules are modelled after
| "bold/italic/underline off-then-on with no text inside"
| rules above.
| But, unlike those roles, are not intended to be permanent.
| These are really required only in .docx importers and,
| to be comprehensive, really should be included for all
| nestable styles (really for all those that are mapped
| from a Word character style).

