| Transition into state 4 only when C-Contents style starts.
| We will then attempt to hold state 4 right through any embedded
| or appended instances of Centered or CG-CenteredWithGuideDots styles.
|028es|~C-Contents.|031~|028es|~C-Contents.|031~1~4~

| Handle boundary from C-Contents into a style that may be in TOC.
| Note that we do not need to handle C-Contents into C-Contents, because
| native importer aggregation handles this for us.
|028ee|~C-Contents.|031|028es|~Centered.|031~|028hl1|031|028rm6|031|028hds0|031~4~
|028ee|~C-Contents.|031|028es|~CG-CenteredWithGuideDots.|031~|028hl1|031|028tab-1c|031|028:|031~4~

| Handle boundary from Centered into a style that may be in TOC.
|028ee|~Centered.|031|028es|~Centered.|031~|028l|031~4~
|028ee|~Centered.|031|028es|~C-Contents.|031~|028hde|031~4~
|028ee|~Centered.|031|028es|~CG-CenteredWithGuideDots.|031~|028hde|031|028tab-1c|031|028:|031~4~

| Handle boundary from CG-CenteredWithGuideDots into a style that may be in TOC.
|028ee|~CG-CenteredWithGuideDots.|031|028es|~CG-CenteredWithGuideDots.|031~|028;|031|028tab-1c|031|028:|031~4~
|028ee|~CG-CenteredWithGuideDots.|031|028es|~Centered.|031~|028tab-1c|031|028:|031|028hds0|031~4~
|028ee|~CG-CenteredWithGuideDots.|031|028es|~C-Contents.|031~|028;|031~4~

| Handle true end of TOC, transitioning out of state 4.
|028ee|~C-Contents.|031~|028ee|~C-Contents.|031~4~1~
|028ee|~Centered.|031~|028hde|031|028ee|~C-Contents.|031~4~1~
|028ee|~CG-CenteredWithGuideDots.|031~|028ee|~C-Contents.|031~4~1~

| Eliminate [font] code, sometimes left after otherwise-successful import
|028font|031~~

